# 1:1 Screenshot Fidelity (cookapp)

Goal: every screen must match `docs/ui-screenshots/` **one-to-one** in structure, hierarchy, spacing, color, type, and interaction chrome — not “inspired by.”

## Source of truth

1. Named file in `docs/ui-screenshots/` for that screen/state.
2. If a state has no screenshot, do not invent UI — ask for a screenshot or reuse the closest existing state.
3. Prefer screenshots over recordings. Ignore status bar, Dynamic Island, and keyboard (see `ui-screenshots.mdc`).

## Before coding a screen

1. Open the matching screenshot(s), including menu-open / empty / filled variants.
2. Inventory only what is on screen: hierarchy, components, copy, icons, states.
3. Extract tokens into CSS/theme variables first (do not hardcode one-offs per screen):
   - brand green, text blacks/greys, surfaces, dividers, destructive red
   - title / body / meta type sizes & weights (serif title vs sans UI)
   - radii (cards, pills, circular buttons, floating tab bar)
   - spacing rhythm (screen padding, grid gutters, list row height, section gaps)
   - effects (nav blur/glass, image gradient scrims, translucent header buttons)
4. Do not add elements absent from the screenshot (extra cards, stat strips, badges, decorative chrome).

## While implementing

- Match **layout geometry**: columns, alignment, floating tab + separate search circle, header button shapes.
- Match **typography roles**: e.g. green large page titles; serif recipe titles; green quantities in ingredient/grocery rows.
- Match **interaction chrome**: circular icon buttons, pill menus, frosted popovers, active tab green pill.
- Empty / loading / menu-open states must use their own screenshots when present.
- Platform chrome (status bar, Dynamic Island, keyboard) is out of scope — never recreate.

## Done only when visually verified

A screen is **not done** until side-by-side check vs the screenshot passes:

| Check | Pass criteria |
|-------|----------------|
| Structure | Same sections, order, and density — nothing extra, nothing missing |
| Spacing | Edges, gaps, and row rhythm match within ~2–4px at phone width |
| Type | Same size/weight/color roles for title, body, meta, accents |
| Color | Same green/grey/red usage; no substitute palette |
| Controls | Same shapes (circle / pill / floating bar); same active/disabled look |
| Overlays | Menus/modals match screenshot state (or dedicated `*-menu-open` file) |

Verification method:

1. Run the app at iPhone-like width.
2. Capture the implemented screen (exclude status bar / Dynamic Island / keyboard from comparison).
3. Compare to `docs/ui-screenshots/<name>.jpg` side-by-side or overlay.
4. Fix deltas before claiming complete; do not “close enough.”

## Anti-patterns (reject)

- Generic SaaS / dashboard layouts
- Invented cards, stat rows, or promo chips not in the shot
- Replacing green accent with purple / cream AI-default themes
- Skipping empty or menu states that have screenshots
- Shipping without a screenshot comparison pass
